   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Airlink&apos;s Airlift Ukraine - Flights to Deliver Aid</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Already, Airlink donors have helped deliver 300+ responders and 354+ tons of aid.  Tons more ready to go if you help today.  Curious how critically needed donated aid will reach refugees, and people in Ukraine?   AIRLINK coordinates and provides free flights, removing the high costs and logistical challenges of transporting emergency humanitarian aid that can prevent or delay it reaching people in need.      Your donation provides sustainable funding to secure/fund airlift and logistics.</narrative>
  </description>
